	(text "Design Notes (Task 62 - MCU_SYNC_BUCK_SYSTEM):\n- 200V->100V Synchronous Buck: 2x IMZA65R015M2H (650V 15mR SiC) with dedicated Kelvin Source (KS) return to UCC5390E GND2/VEE2.\n- Separate turn-on (10R) and fast turn-off (3.3R + B340A Schottky) gate paths + 10k G-KS bleed on both HS and LS MOSFETs.\n- High-side UCC5390E powered via 600V bootstrap diode (US1J) + 4.7R + 1uF/100nF caps referenced to HS_KS.\n- INA240A1 monitors 5mR low-side shunt (CM=0V, within -4V..80V spec) with Vs/2 midpoint bias (REF1=+3V3, REF2=GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 345.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f20c0523-b02e-4bb3-8f72-e0991af45386")
	)
